    <color r="255" g="255" b="255">
     <font name="Malgun Gothic" size="12" shadowx="2" shadowy="1" shadowa="50">Fun Facts about the Hourglass Dolphin</font>
    </color>
   </cell>
   <p />
   <cell width="280" bgimg="ui/zoopedia/factBG.tga" padx="10">
    <p />
    <cell width="32" pady="10">
     <img src="ui/zoopedia/fact-bullet.tga" sx="0" sy="0" sw="32" sh="32" />
    </cell>
    <cell width="202" pady="10">
     <color r="255" g="255" b="255"><font name="Malgun Gothic" size="10">This nicely coloured dolphin is a fast swimmer.</font></color>
    </cell>
	<cell width="32" pady="10">
		<img src="ui/zoopedia/fact-bullet.tga" sx="0" sy="0" sw="32" sh="32" />
	</cell>    
    <cell width="202" pady="10">
     <color r="255" g="255" b="255"><font name="Malgun Gothic" size="10">This dolphin probably eats cephalopods and small fish.</font></color>
    </cell>
	<cell width="32" pady="10">
		<img src="ui/zoopedia/fact-bullet.tga" sx="0" sy="0" sw="32" sh="32" />
	</cell>            
    <cell width="202" pady="10">
     <color r="255" g="255" b="255"><font name="Malgun Gothic" size="10">Their length varies from 5.3 ft. (1.63 m.) to 5.9 ft. (1.80 m.). Females are slightly larger than males.</font></color>     
    </cell>
